   <children>
      <Label alignment="TOP_LEFT" layoutX="4.0" layoutY="5.0" prefHeight="208.0" prefWidth="591.0" text="This is a tower defense game.                                        1. Select preferred difficulty, then the game will automatically start presenting you with three lanes(Easy) or five lanes(Hard) and 4 weapons to choose from.                                                 2. Choose which weapon you want to buy then select the lane you want to place the weapon in and the weapon willappear automatically. You can also choose to pass the turn.                                                3. You will keep going until you inevitably lose all lanes present.                                                4. A lane is lost when titans reach the wall of a lane and attack it until its health is zero.                                                            5. There is no win condition, keep going to get a high score!                                                                                 Good luck!" wrapText="true">
         <font>
            <Font size="13.0" />
         </font>
      </Label>
